# Docs Content (Fumadocs MDX)

## File pairs

Every topic ships as two files in the same folder: `<page>.mdx` (English) and `<page>.ar.mdx` (Arabic). Same headings structure, same tables, same components.

## Frontmatter

```yaml
---
title: Short keyword-first title
description: One sentence, plain words, no banned characters
---
```

## Section navigation

New pages must be added to the section's `meta.json` `pages` array (and new sections to `content/docs/meta.json`). A page not in `meta.json` will not show in the sidebar.

## Writing conventions

- Navigation paths use `>`: **Settings > Branding**
- Status flows in prose: "Pending, then Preparing, then Ready" (never arrows)
- UI element names in bold: **Adjust Stock**
- Use `<Callout>`, `<Steps>`, `<Cards>` components as the existing docs do
- No em-dashes, en-dashes, or arrows anywhere (see content-style rule)
- Docs feed `llms.txt` and `llms-full.txt` automatically; frontmatter quality directly affects AI search answers
